This product includes software developed as part of Briiv_HA
(https://github.com/FiveCreate/Briiv_HA) by FiveCreate, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. That project established the local UDP protocol
this integration speaks to Briiv air purifiers.

Portions of this software are derived from that work and have been modified.
The changes include a rewritten device and entity model, corrected sensor
types, availability tracking, reconfiguration and diagnostics support, and an
additional connection through the Briiv cloud service.
